-- Lan–sabuk éfodipun ingkang wonten–inggiling saking–piyambakipun piyambakipun kados–damelipun emas biru lan–wungu lan–abrit cemeng lan–linen–alus pinotong kados dipundhawuhaken Yéhuwah dhateng–ꞌ Musa

